// file-name tables, indexed by these ids). Generated by games/mummymaze/tools/make_res.py from the exe:
//   gImageNames 0x492410 (165), loaded by MummyApp::LoadImage (0x41db90) as GetImage("images\\" + name)
//   gSoundNames 0x4926a4 (25), loaded by the loading thread (0x41dd60) as LoadSound(id, "sounds\\" + name)
// Every id is used as mApp->mImages[IMAGE_X] and PlaySample(SOUND_X). The 6, 8 and 10 variants are the three
// maze sizes' tiles (the id of the 6 variant plus 0, 1 or 2).

